\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{2}(p)=\left(\begin{array}{cc}
2 & c\end{array}\right)^{\prime},c\geq0$
\end_inset

.
 So, 
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{x}=\left(\begin{array}{cc}
4 & t+c\end{array}\right)^{\prime}$
\end_inset

, where 
\begin_inset Formula $t+c\geq\frac{7}{2}$
\end_inset

.
 Important to note, as long as 
\begin_inset Formula $t+c\in[\frac{7}{2},4]$
