.
 So, 
\begin_inset Formula $\hat{x}(p)=\left(\begin{array}{cc}
2+2p+\frac{8-4p}{4+p} & \frac{2(p+7)}{p+4}\end{array}\right)^{\prime}$
\end_inset

.
 Let us consider the market for the good 2.
 By the market clearing condition, we have
